# ROOT .gitignore -- WHITELIST (git root = Phone Maintenance/). This folder also holds Benny's NON-PoGo phone work
# (root/Magisk, Threads, tether, dumps): all of it stays out. Only the PoGo trees and the repo's own files go in.
# Code + docs live in git; the game DATA lives on the phone (tools/pogo_data.py + tools/data_manifest.txt).
/*

# the repo's own files
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/assets/
!/docs/
docs/memory/
!/cloud/
!/tools/

# community + GitHub files
!/LICENSE
!/.github/

# the PoGo trees (each has its own .gitignore)
!/pogo_extract/
!/AutoCatcher/

# PokeGenie tooling: the scripts only (its data, ~590 MB, stays out)
!/pokegenie_work/
/pokegenie_work/*
!/pokegenie_work/*.py
!/pokegenie_work/README.md

# AI config / session / memory files (never tracked)
.claude/
.grill/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.agents/
docs/memory/
pogo_extract/CLAUDE.md

# never, at any depth
__pycache__/
*.pyc
